ज्वल् ज्व॑लति (ज्व॑ल˚ते), pp. ज्वलित (q.v.) blaze,
flame, burn, glow, shine. C. ज्वलयति & ज्वालयति set on fire,
illuminate. I. जाज्वलीति & जाज्वल्यते flame violently, be brilliant.
— अभि shine, C. = अव C. illuminate. उद् blaze up, flame, shine;
C. = S. C. प्र flame up, shine forth;
 C. set on fire, kindle.
अभिप्र & संप्र flame up, catch fire प्रति blaze, burn. अभिवि
flame against or opposite to. सम् blaze, flame;
 C. kindle, illuminate.

ज्वाल॑ m. light, flame (also ज्वाला f.);
 torch, hot
infusion.

ज्वलन॑ a. burning, flaming, combustible;
 m. fire (also
ज्व॑लन or ज्वल॑न);
 n. burning, blazing.
